        | настройка                                      | режим                 | доля |
        | без restore.postgresql_lock_share              | single transaction    | 0.5  |
        | с restore.postgresql_lock_share 0.25 в agent.d | single transaction    | 0.25 |
        | с restore.postgresql_lock_share 0              | separate transactions | 0    |

